1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,429
Meet StockCast.

2
00:00:01,179 --> 00:00:04,100
A full-stack app that forecasts stock prices.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,714
The React frontend on GitHub Pages

4
00:00:06,464 --> 00:00:08,878
calls a FastAPI backend on Render,

5
00:00:08,628 --> 00:00:11,750
which pulls prices from Yahoo Finance, or a CSV.

6
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:14,116
The backend has five modules:

7
00:00:13,866 --> 00:00:15,776
routes, data, six models,

8
00:00:15,526 --> 00:00:18,050
a backtest engine, and risk analysis.

9
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:20,876
Each model is tested on days it never saw,

10
00:00:20,626 --> 00:00:22,424
ranked by error, then refit

11
00:00:22,174 --> 00:00:24,850
to forecast the future, with confidence bands.

12
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:27,932
You get forecasts, technical indicators,

13
00:00:27,682 --> 00:00:29,473
and a full risk report.

14
00:00:29,223 --> 00:00:31,000
Live on GitHub Pages.
